  "slug": "mushroom-lentil-pasta",
  "name": "Mushroom and lentil pasta",
  "description": "A deep mushroom and lentil sauce with crumbled tofu standing in for ricotta, tossed through pasta with tomato, garlic and basil.",
  "iconKey": "fork_knife",
  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pan over medium-high heat and cook the mushrooms for 6 minutes, until browned and dry.",
    "Add the garlic and the chopped tomato and cook for 3 minutes, until the tomato collapses.",
    "Crumble in the tofu, add the lentils and the salt, and simmer for 4 minutes, until the sauce holds together.",
    "Toss the cooked pasta through the sauce until every strand is coated.",
    "Divide between two plates and scatter the torn basil over."
